{"author":{"id":"1949ffc23f11a8cb4f8c42a45c9ad241b49570df9a18687489e9ea78d87c54a3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1773081336,"nonce":"+WUt8rurMaImjiCjPKs70ta1G4w=","title":"Auto-save failure: no user-visible feedback when PUT fails","message":"When the debounced auto-save PUT request fails, only console.warn is called. The isDirty dot remains (correct) but the user has no visible indication their work is not being saved.\n\nFix: add a non-blocking toast notification on auto-save failure. No toast library currently installed — need to add sonner (or equivalent) and wire it up in App.tsx.\n\nFailure cases to surface:\n- Network error / server unreachable\n- 4xx/5xx from FastAPI\n- Should NOT show on first-load spurious save failures","files":null}]}